 Silicon Valley's rise to global prominence. Through interviews with founders and insiders — including Steve Wozniak — and extensive archival material, it examines the roles of startups, venture capital, academia, and corporate culture in shaping technological innovation. The film explores themes of entrepreneurship, economic power, globalization, and the narratives that mythologize tech success. Its tone is illuminating and analytical, prompting viewers to reassess familiar origin stories even as it sometimes leans toward celebratory accounts.", "external": {"imdb": {"id": "tt8128854", "user_rating": 7.1, "user_rating_count": 135}}, "filming_location": "", "finale_year": 2018, "image": {"url": "https://images.qloo.com/i/4CCB9933-19F9-4AB1-A862-9BCBA857F58F-420x-auto.jpg"}, "is_special": false, "production_company": "Kikim Media", "release_country": "United States", "release_date": "2018-03-19", "release_year": 2018, "short_descriptions": [{"language": "en", "value": "A documentary tracing the cultural, financial, and institutional forces that transformed Silicon Valley into a global technological and economic powerhouse."}, {"language": "de", "value": "Eine Dokumentation, die die kulturellen, finanziellen und institutionellen Kräfte untersucht, die das Silicon Valley in eine globale Technologie- und Wirtschaftsmacht verwandelt haben."}, {"language": "es", "value": "Un documental que examina las fuerzas culturales, financieras e institucionales que convirtieron Silicon Valley en una potencia tecnológica y económica global."}, {"language": "fr", "value": "Un documentaire qui examine les forces culturelles, financières et institutionnelles ayant transformé la Silicon Valley en une puissance technologique et économique mondiale."}], "website": "https://vimeo.com/244123273"}, "disambiguation": "2018,2018", "tags": [{"name": "Pioneering", "tag_id": "urn:tag:character:qloo:pioneering", "type": "urn:tag:character:qloo"}, {"name": "Entrepreneurial", "tag_id": "urn:tag:chara